  "rows": {
    "900.5.10(352)": {
      "explanation": "In Exception RT 352, the floor area you can build on a lot with a dwelling unit is capped by lot size: on lots under 408 m2, the lesser of 0.6 times the lot area or 204 m2; on lots of 408 m2 to 697 m2, the lesser of 0.5 times the lot area or 279 m2; on lots over 697 m2, 0.4 times the lot area. No former by-laws or prevailing sections apply.",
